Derivative works
----------------
The following files are modified versions of files from the upstream project
(both the copy under src/ and the deployment copy under patches/):

  - gateway/server.ts
  - config.ts
  - core/store/factory.ts
  - core/store/store-pool.ts
  - utils/manifest.ts

Original works
--------------
All other files in this repository are original to this project, including:

  - core/store/pg-store.ts — new PostgreSQL implementation of the IMemoryStore
    interface (patches/pg-store-original.ts is its pre-bugfix revision)
  - patches/fix-*.js / *.cjs / fix-yaml.py / create-db.js — in-container patch
    application scripts
  - deploy/ — service startup and verification scripts
  - db/schema.sql — PostgreSQL DDL
  - scripts/ — LangGraph demo chat application

